  {
   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# AI Text Loading\n\nA cycling status word whose letters blur in one by one while a soft brightness wave runs through them: the look of an AI that is working.\n\nCategory: typography. Length: 7.5 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A video needs a 'working on it' beat: an assistant thinking, a process running, a wait before a result.\n- A short list of status words should cycle with a calm, premium feel.\n\nAvoid when:\n- The words must be read as a sentence: use per-word-crossfade.\n- A real progress bar or percentage is needed.\n\nVariables:\n- texts (string): Words, default \"Thinking...|Processing...|Analyzing...|Computing...|Almost...\"\n- interval (number, 0.6-4): Interval, default 1.5\n- font_size (number, 16-200): Font size, default 64\n- color (color): Color, default \"#0a0a0a\"\n- show_elapsed (boolean): Show elapsed, default false\n- font_weight (enum): Font weight, default \"700\"\n\nSource: https://github.com/kokonut-labs/kokonutui. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
   "role": "source",
   "content": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  AI Text Loading\n\n  A status word that cycles through a list (Thinking, Processing, Analyzing...): each word's letters blur in one after another while a soft brightness wave runs through them, then the word lifts away.\n\n  Ported to an HTML + GSAP sub-composition by usemosio/blocks from:\n  https://github.com/kokonut-labs/kokonutui/blob/4d497b7b03f02ffd07225e638c0b9ace3f892dbb/components/kokonutui/ai-text-loading.tsx\n\n  MIT License\n\n  Copyright (c) 2025 kokonutUI\n\n  Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\n  of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal\n  in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights\n  to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell\n  copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is\n  furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n\n  The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\n  copies or substantial portions of the Software.\n\n  THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\n  IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,\n  FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE\n  AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER\n  LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,\n  OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE\n  SOFTWARE.\n-->\n<html\n  lang=\"en\"\n  data-composition-id=\"ai-text-loading\"\n  data-composition-duration=\"7.5\"\n  data-composition-variables='[\n    {\"id\": \"texts\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Words\", \"description\": \"Status words separated by |. Each one is shown in turn.\", \"default\": \"Thinking...|Processing...|Analyzing...|Computing...|Almost...\"},\n    {\"id\": \"interval\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Interval\", \"description\": \"Seconds each word stays up. The block lasts 5 words at the default 1.5 s.\", \"default\": 1.5, \"min\": 0.6, \"max\": 4, \"step\": 0.1, \"unit\": \"s\"},\n    {\"id\": \"font_size\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font size\", \"description\": \"Text size in pixels. Long words shrink to fit the frame.\", \"default\": 64, \"min\": 16, \"max\": 200, \"step\": 1, \"unit\": \"px\"},\n    {\"id\": \"color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Color\", \"description\": \"Text color.\", \"default\": \"#0a0a0a\"},\n    {\"id\": \"show_elapsed\", \"type\": \"boolean\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Show elapsed\", \"description\": \"Show the seconds spent so far next to the word.\", \"default\": false},\n    {\"id\": \"font_weight\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font weight\", \"description\": \"Weight of the text.\", \"default\": \"700\", \"options\": [{\"value\": \"600\", \"label\": \"Semibold\"}, {\"value\": \"700\", \"label\": \"Bold\"}, {\"value\": \"800\", \"label\": \"Extra bold\"}]}\n  ]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>AI Text Loading</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@600;700;800&amp;display=block\" />\n      <style>\n        #root { position: absolute; inset: 0; overflow: hidden; container-type: size; pointer-events: none; }\n        #root { color: var(--atl-color, #0a0a0a); font-family: var(--font-display, Geist, system-ui, sans-serif); }\n        .atl-stage { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5em; align-content: center; }\n        .atl-words { position: relative; display: grid; justify-items: center; align-items: center; }\n        .atl-word { grid-area: 1 / 1; display: flex; justify-content: center; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }\n        .atl-letter { display: inline-block; opacity: 0; }\n        .atl-wave { display: inline-block; }\n        .atl-elapsed { font-size: 0.5em; font-weight: 500; opacity: 0.4; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"ai-text-loading\" data-duration=\"7.5\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"atl-clip\" class=\"atl-stage clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"7.5\" data-track-index=\"0\" style=\"align-items:center\">\n          <span id=\"atl-words\" class=\"atl-words\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n          <span id=\"atl-elapsed\" class=\"atl-elapsed\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/CustomEase.min.js\"></script>\n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n            var root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n            var vars = window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables() : {};\n            function num(v, f, a, b) { var x = Number(v); return Number.isFinite(x) ? Math.min(b, Math.max(a, x)) : f; }\n            function str(v, f) { return typeof v === \"string\" && v.trim() ? v : f; }\n            function col(v, f) { return typeof v === \"string\" && v ? v : f; }\n            function mulberry32(a) { return function () { a |= 0; a = (a + 0x6d2b79f5) | 0; var t = Math.imul(a ^ (a >>> 15), 1 | a); t = (t + Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 7), 61 | t)) ^ t; return ((t ^ (t >>> 14)) >>> 0) / 4294967296; }; }\n            function clamp01(x) { return x < 0 ? 0 : x > 1 ? 1 : x; }\n\n\n            var holder = document.getElementById(\"atl-words\");\n            var elapsedEl = document.getElementById(\"atl-elapsed\");\n            var words = str(vars.texts, \"Thinking...|Processing...|Analyzing...|Computing...|Almost...\").split(\"|\").map(function (s) { return s.trim(); }).filter(Boolean);\n            if (!words.length) words = [\"Thinking...\"];\n            var interval = num(vars.interval, 1.5, 0.6, 4);\n            var showElapsed = vars.show_elapsed === true || vars.show_elapsed === \"true\";\n            var weight = [\"600\", \"700\", \"800\"].indexOf(String(vars.font_weight)) >= 0 ? String(vars.font_weight) : \"700\";\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--atl-color\", col(vars.color, \"#0a0a0a\"));\n            elapsedEl.style.display = showElapsed ? \"\" : \"none\";\n            holder.style.fontWeight = weight;\n            var size = num(vars.font_size, 64, 16, 200);\n            holder.style.fontSize = size + \"px\";\n\n            gsap.registerPlugin(CustomEase);\n            // cubic-bezier(0.23, 1, 0.32, 1), the source's ease-out.\n            var easeOut = CustomEase.create(\"atl-out\", \"M0,0 C0.23,1 0.32,1 1,1\");\n\n            // Every word is built once; only the active one is visible.\n            var entries = words.map(function (w, wi) {\n              var el = document.createElement(\"span\");\n              el.className = \"atl-word\";\n              el.setAttribute(\"aria-hidden\", \"true\");\n              var letters = Array.from(w).map(function (ch) {\n                var outer = document.createElement(\"span\");\n                outer.className = \"atl-letter\";\n                var inner = document.createElement(\"span\");\n                inner.className = \"atl-wave\";\n                inner.textContent = ch;\n                outer.appendChild(inner);\n                el.appendChild(outer);\n                return { outer: outer, inner: inner };\n              });\n              holder.appendChild(el);\n              return { el: el, letters: letters, start: wi * interval };\n            });\n            // Shrink to 88 % of the frame width when the widest word is wider.\n            var widest = 0;\n            entries.forEach(function (e) { widest = Math.max(widest, e.el.scrollWidth); });\n            var avail = root.clientWidth * 0.88 - (showElapsed ? size * 1.6 : 0);\n            if (widest > avail) { size = Math.max(16, size * avail / widest); holder.style.fontSize = size + \"px\"; }\n\n            var tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });\n            entries.forEach(function (e, wi) {\n              var t0 = e.start;\n              var last = wi === entries.length - 1;\n              e.el.style.visibility = \"hidden\";\n              tl.set(e.el, { visibility: \"visible\" }, t0);\n              e.letters.forEach(function (l, i) {\n                // 0.018 s between letters, 0.28 s each: opacity, lift and blur settle together.\n                tl.fromTo(l.outer, { opacity: 0, y: 8, filter: \"blur(4px)\" }, { opacity: 1, y: 0, filter: \"blur(0px)\", duration: 0.28, ease: easeOut, immediateRender: false }, t0 + i * 0.018);\n              });\n              if (!last) {\n                var tx = t0 + interval;\n                tl.to(e.el, { opacity: 0, y: -6, filter: \"blur(3px)\", duration: 0.15, ease: easeOut }, tx);\n                tl.set(e.el, { visibility: \"hidden\" }, tx + 0.15);\n              }\n            });\n            // The brightness wave: each letter dips to 30 % and back every 1.6 s, 0.07 s behind its neighbour.\n            var clock = { t: 0 };\n            function draw(t) {\n              entries.forEach(function (e, wi) {\n                if (t < e.start || (wi < entries.length - 1 && t > e.start + interval + 0.2)) return;\n                var local = t - e.start;\n                e.letters.forEach(function (l, i) {\n                  var ph = (local - i * 0.07) / 1.6;\n                  var o = 1;\n                  if (ph > 0) { var f = ph - Math.floor(ph); o = 0.65 + 0.35 * Math.cos(2 * Math.PI * f); }\n                  l.inner.style.opacity = o.toFixed(3);\n                });\n              });\n              if (showElapsed) elapsedEl.textContent = Math.floor(t) + \"s\";\n            }\n            tl.to(clock, { t: parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"7.5\"), duration: parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"7.5\"), ease: \"none\", onUpdate: function () { draw(clock.t); } }, 0);\n            draw(0);\n\n            var total = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"7.5\");\n            if (tl.duration() < total) tl.to({}, { duration: total - tl.duration() });\n            tl.seek(0);\n            window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};\n            window.__timelines[\"ai-text-loading\"] = tl;\n          })();\n        </script>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
  }
 ],
 "sha256": "ff889eec166fcc5c2a017de5a76db3909a208e043e076b584f74e0fefb6976f8",
